data: {"id": "bb0b13f8b89a42b2-thinking-parallel_evidence-2600", "run_id": "bb0b13f8b89a42b2", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 证据结论\n\n**实体身份确认**\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv`\n- **UID**: `7f78dcbf-0a84-437d-b1c1-e376d407c9c0`\n- **状态**: `Pending` (Phase=Pending, Waiting=ImagePullBackOff, Restarts=0)\n- **容器**: `app` (镜像: `registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing`)\n- **拓扑**: 归属 `Deployment/workload` -> `ReplicaSet/workload-65b7f54794`，调度在 `node2`。\n\n**支持候选原因 `ImagePullFailed` 的事实**\n1.  **Kubernetes Events**: 明确显示 `Failed to pull image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\"`，错误原文为 `dial tcp: lookup", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788767803145, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

