data: {"id": "bb0b13f8b89a42b2-final", "run_id": "bb0b13f8b89a42b2", "seq": 2605, "ts_ms": 1788767820411, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv` | ImagePullBackOff | Pod aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv 持续处于 ImagePullBackOff 状态，无法启动。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | Kubernetes (kubelet) | `Warning Failed ... dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host` | 直接证明 DNS 解析失败，无法定位镜像仓库。 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes (kubelet) | `Normal BackOff ... Back-off pulling image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\"` | 证实 kubelet 正处于镜像拉取退避等待状态。 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | Kubernetes (kubelet) | `Warning Failed Error: ErrImagePull` | 证实镜像拉取操作已产生明确的错误码。 |\n| 4 | K8s State | Kubernetes (Pod Status) | `status: Pending` | 证实容器未进入运行状态。 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` = 1 (reason=ImagePullBackOff) | 验证 Pod 正处于 ImagePullBackOff 状态（单样本，无趋势）。 |\n| 6 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` = 0 | 证实容器尚未成功启动过。 |\n\n**证据印证：**\nKubernetes 事件明确指出了 DNS 解析失败的具体原因是“lookup registry.invalid ... no such host” [1]，这直接导致了 `ErrImagePull` [3] 和随后的退避行为 [2]。监控指标仅反映了最终状态 [4, 5, 6]，未提供比事件更早的线索。由于容器未能启动，Logging 和 Tracing 维度无可观测事实。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 配置了无效域名 registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing → \nDNS 解析失败 (lookup no such host) → \nkubelet 镜像拉取报错 (ErrImagePull) → \nPod 进入 ImagePullBackOff 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因：** Pod 配置的镜像地址使用了无效域名 `registry.invalid`，导致 kubelet 执行镜像拉取时发生 DNS 解析失败，进而引发 `ImagePullBackOff`。\n\n**证据引用：** Kubernetes 事件 `fact-2f72ff94c0eb` 中记录了明确的 `no such host` 错误，证实了域名无法解析；`fact-2224d1345b22` 确认了后续的 BackOff 状态。所有证据一致指向该配置错误。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 44.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 30.2s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv: 30.2s (Evidence 21.5s, RCA 8.6s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.5s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv**: pod-imagepull-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 83.414, "metrics": {"run_id": "bb0b13f8b89a42b2", "mttr": {"value": "1.4m", "seconds": 83.42043113708496, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-imagepull-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 83420.43113708496, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 79031.29243850708, "tool_calls": 13, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_calls": 11, "failed_tool_calls": 2, "tool_duration_ms": 9447.903633117676, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 4070.0442790985107}, "nodes": {"layer": {"